  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">State and National Policy and Advocacy Impact</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focus on child rights, citizenship and governance, and prevention of alcohol  abuse. The project will help the state of Karnataka to fulfill its constitutional and legislative commitments of devolution of power to rural and urban self-governments to make it more participatory, transparent and accountable.  It will also contribute to that the State will better regulate the sale of alcohol and reduce the alcohol-related harm.</narrative>
  </description>
